# Repository-root ignore rules for SENTINEL.
#
# backend/.gitignore remains in force for the backend tree and is not
# superseded by this file. These rules are additive and exist to keep
# generated and machine-local artifacts out of the repository when work is
# imported from several branches at once.
#
# In particular, commit 9d1c7dc on abhy_ai ("handoff-final") added a committed
# virtualenv at .venv_312/ containing 7,483 files, including macOS binaries
# built for the author's machine. Nothing of that kind may enter this
# repository again.

# --- Virtual environments ---
# Any interpreter environment, at the root or nested in a subproject.
.venv*/
**/.venv/
venv/
**/venv/
.env
**/.env

# --- Node / frontend build output ---
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
dist/
**/dist/
.vite/
**/.vite/

# --- Trained model artifacts ---
# Models are rebuilt from source with `make train`; the binary artifact must
# never be committed. models/metrics.json stays tracked because it is the
# reviewable record of a training run.
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.joblib
*.onnx
*.ubj

# --- Python caches and coverage ---
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
.coverage
**/.coverage
htmlcov/
**/htmlcov/

# --- Generated SUMO output ---
# Scenario inputs (sumocfg, net, nod, edg, rou, signals.json) are committed on
# purpose. Everything SUMO writes while running is not.
simulation/output/
**/simulation/output/
simulation/runs/
**/simulation/runs/
# Regenerated SUMO networks are derived data. Scenario metadata (sumocfg,
# signals.json) is committed next to them under simulation/scenarios/, but the
# .net.xml itself is rebuilt from OSM by scripts/import_road_network.py and the
# documented netconvert invocation, never committed.
simulation/networks/
**/simulation/networks/
*.net.xml
# SUMO writes tripinfos.xml, stats.xml and edgeData.xml with no infix, so the
# dotted forms alone do not match the files that were actually committed on
# simulation-lavanya. Both spellings are listed on purpose.
*.tripinfo.xml
tripinfos.xml
*.stats.xml
stats.xml
*.edgeData.xml
edgeData.xml
*.fcd.xml
*.emission.xml
*.netstate.xml
*.summary.xml
*.queue.xml
*.rou.xml.alt.xml

# --- Local tooling ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
